{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2021-09-29 07:00:00', 'title': 'U.S. MEDICAL MANAGEMENT ACCOUNTABLE CARE PARTNERS (ACO) IMPROVES QUALITY OF CARE AND GENERATES SHARED SAVINGS THROUGH CMS SHARED SAVINGS PROGRAM IN 2020', 'text': 'TROY, MICH., SEPT. 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE CENTERS FOR MEDICARE & MEDICAID SERVICES (CMS) RELEASED THE 2020 PERFORMANCE YEAR RESULTS FOR THE MEDICARE SHARED SAVINGS PROGRAM (MSSP) ACCOUNTABLE CARE ORGANIZATIONS (ACOS).'}